{"id":"e9af284cd2d6f1aa","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-concatenation.md","title":"Base-b Number Concatenation","display":"df-smullyan-concatenation — Base-b Number Concatenation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-concatenation","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-concatenation"],"display":"df-smullyan-concatenation — Base-b Number Concatenation","source":"第 II 章 pp. 20–22，Proposition 1（PDF 37–39）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-concatenation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-concatenation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-concatenation — Base-b Number Concatenation"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 20–22，Proposition 1（PDF 37–39）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\geq2\">\\(b\\geq2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\ell_b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*_b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(*_b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为下文定义的长度函数与数字拼接；它们都是外部数函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}concatenation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\ell_b(0)&amp;\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\ell_b(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{k\\geq1\\mid b^k&gt;n\\}\\quad(n&gt;0),\\\\\nm*_bn&amp;\\coloneqq m\\,b^{\\ell_b(n)}+n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}concatenation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\ell_b(0)&amp;\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\ell_b(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{k\\geq1\\mid b^k&gt;n\\}\\quad(n&gt;0),\\\\\nm*_bn&amp;\\coloneqq m\\,b^{\\ell_b(n)}+n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零也有一位数字。若中间因子为零，拼接并不满足结合律：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(5*_{10}0)*_{10}3=503\">\\((5*_{10}0)*_{10}3=503\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"5*_{10}(0*_{10}3)=53\">\\(5*_{10}(0*_{10}3)=53\\)</span>。省略括号时按原书约定始终向左结合。</p>\n<p>对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>，图关系是原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_E\">\\(\\mathcal L_E\\)</span> 中的 Arithmetic 关系：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b^{\\ell_b(n)}\">\\(b^{\\ell_b(n)}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 时是严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 次幂，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>；再用乘法、加法和存在量词表达图。这里未把“Arithmetic”误写成局部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 或本地素数幂编码的 PR 结论。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 20–22，Proposition 1（PDF 37–39）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n<p>第 IV 章在素数底下进一步给出构造算术图，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73270f29098db683\" href=\"?note=73270f29098db683\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation\">92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation</a>。该节点显式修正原书 bounded 显示式的零左因子边界；不能无条件把位长幂见证限制到最终值之内。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"73270f29098db683","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"第 IV 章在素数底下进一步给出构造算术图，见 [[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]]。该节点显式修正原书 bounded 显示式的零左因子边界；不能无条件把位长幂见证限制到最终值之内。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"*_b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}concatenation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\ell_b(0)&\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\ell_b(n)&\\coloneqq\\min\\{k\\geq1\\mid b^k>n\\}\\quad(n>0),\\\\\nm*_bn&\\coloneqq m\\,b^{\\ell_b(n)}+n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(5*_{10}0)*_{10}3=503","display":false},{"tex":"5*_{10}(0*_{10}3)=53","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_E","display":false},{"tex":"b^{\\ell_b(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false}],"bytes":1758,"backlinks":[{"id":"e05c7a445ae4a4cd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]] → [[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]] → [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code]]。"},{"id":"73270f29098db683","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p\\geq2$ 为素数，$x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N$；$*_p$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smu